<view class="food-page">
  <view class="food-hero">
    <view class="food-kicker">控糖饮食参考</view>
    <view class="food-title">食物</view>
    <view class="food-subtitle">记录常见食物的控糖友好程度，随机搭配一份日常食谱。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice-card">
    以下内容仅供饮食记录和日常参考，不能替代医生或营养师建议；如有孕期、用药或其他特殊情况，请以专业建议为准。
  </view>

  <view class="section-head">
    <view>
      <view class="section-title">食物清单</view>
      <view class="section-desc">避免绝对判断，更多关注份量、搭配和记录反馈。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="food-count">{{filteredFoods.length}} 项</view>
  </view>

  <scroll-view class="category-scroll" scroll-x enable-flex>
    <view class="category-row">
      <view
        wx:for="{{categories}}"
        wx:key="key"
        class="category-chip {{item.active ? 'category-chip-active' : ''}}"
        data-key="{{item.key}}"
        bindtap="onSelectCategory"
      >
        {{item.label}}
      </view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>

  <view class="food-list">
    <view wx:for="{{filteredFoods}}" wx:key="id" class="food-card friendliness-{{item.friendlinessKey}}">
      <view class="food-card-head">
        <view>
          <view class="food-name">{{item.name}}</view>
          <view class="food-meta">{{item.categoryLabel}} · {{item.giText}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="friendliness-badge friendliness-badge-{{item.friendlinessKey}}">{{item.friendliness}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="portion-row">
        <text class="portion-label">建议份量</text>
        <text class="portion-value">{{item.portion}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="food-desc">{{item.description}}</view>
      <view class="food-tip">提醒：{{item.tips}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="recipe-card">
    <view class="section-title">随机食谱</view>
    <view class="section-desc">选择餐次后，随机给出一份本地食谱。</view>

    <scroll-view class="meal-scroll" scroll-x enable-flex>
      <view class="meal-row">
        <view
          wx:for="{{mealTypes}}"
          wx:key="key"
          class="meal-chip {{item.active ? 'meal-chip-active' : ''}}"
          data-key="{{item.key}}"
          bindtap="onSelectMealType"
        >
          {{item.label}}
        </view>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>

    <view wx:if="{{selectedRecipe}}" class="recipe-result">
      <view class="recipe-title">{{selectedRecipe.title}}</view>
      <view class="recipe-meal">{{selectedRecipe.mealLabel}}</view>
      <view class="recipe-foods">
        <text wx:for="{{selectedRecipe.foods}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="recipe-line">
        <text class="recipe-label">份量</text>
        <text>{{selectedRecipe.portion}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="recipe-line">
        <text class="recipe-label">做法</text>
        <text>{{selectedRecipe.steps}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="recipe-tip">提醒：{{selectedRecipe.tips}}</view>
    </view>

    <view wx:else class="recipe-empty">
      还没有抽取食谱，先选一个餐次吧。
    </view>

    <view class="recipe-action" bindtap="onRandomRecipe">
      {{selectedRecipe ? "再来一份" : "随机来一份控糖食谱"}}
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="ai-card">
    <view class="ai-title">AI 饮食问答</view>
    <view class="ai-desc">后续可用于询问食材搭配、食谱记录和日常控糖提醒。</view>
    <view class="ai-state">敬请期待</view>
  </view>
</view>
